### Equation for WCD:
The WCD is calculated as:
\[
WCD_f = \sum_{h \in \text{path}} D_f^h + \text{propagation delay} \times \text{hop count} + \text{switching delay} \times \text{hop count}
\]
where \(D_f^h\) is the worst-case per-hop delay (assumed 12 µs per hop in this example). For a more accurate calculation, \(D_f^h\) should be derived from the CBS service curve deviation.

